   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the real property tax law, in relation to providing an\nexemption against certain fiber optic cable assessments for municipal fiber\noptic broadband companies in Erie county; and providing for the repeal of such\nprovisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8978",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8978-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
